  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Word of Blake Militia inherited ComStar's combined-arms organizational philosophy and its Star League-era equipment stocks, fielding infantry formations that ranked among the best equipped in the Inner Sphere during the Jihad. Crewing light-class medium autocannon that balance range, hitting power, and ammunition economy, these gunners provide reliable direct fire support across a wider engagement envelope than standard autocannon of comparable weight.</p>"
